---
// No props needed - static content
---

<section class="gap-14 border-y border-stroke-weak-dark">
    <div
        class="flex flex-col-reverse sm:flex-row py-12 sm:py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto gap-12 sm:gap-0 justify-between border-x border-stroke-weak-dark items-start sm:items-center"
    >
        <div class="max-w-100 sm:max-w-1/3 px-4 sm:px-6">
            <div class="p-6 bg-bg-light pb-18 sm:pb-18">
                <img src="/about/happy-pic.webp" alt="Oleksii Zhuk" />
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 grow">
            <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-medium">My story</h2>
            <div
                class="flex flex-col gap-4 leading leading-loose text-text-secondary"
            >
                <div
                    class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-base sm:text-lg leading-loose text-balance max-w-[50ch]"
                >
                    <p>
                        Since early childhood, I've enjoyed crafting things with
                        my grandpa at his workshop on a balcony. We would devise
                        ridiculous ideas tinkering with leftover parts from old
                        stuff. When I was home alone, I'd sit on the floor
                        building imaginary spaceships, racecars, and robots from
                        Lego parts.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Now I turn ideas into reality with companies and
                        startups from all around the world, and I can't imagine
                        my life without doing it.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
